{"c":[{"name":"20261007T132116Z-e94ee4791db7e513","text":"The helper executor replaces whole fields; caret/selection/append insertion runs in the host or extension and never enters the executor undo ledger.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261007T144012Z-e2952279328219e3","text":"Every Ask route asks Jev's per-field scope question (purpose ask.scope) first, so a test Jev stand-in must answer it: wrap it with answeringScope in helper/test/builders.ts, or Asks refuse or ask back.","type":"note"}]}
